                    </div>


                    <div class="image__metadata">
                        <div itemprop="caption" class="image__caption attribution">

                            <span data-editable="metaCaption" class="inline-placeholder">An image taken on June 19th
                                shows a line of sixteen dump trucks near the entrances, along with earthmoving
                                equipment.</span>

                        </div>
                        <figcaption class="image__credit">Maxar Technologies</figcaption>
                    </div>

                </div>

                <p class="paragraph inline-placeholder paragraph"
                    data-uri="cms.cnn.com/_components/paragraph/instances/cmc76rcdr00023b6nf92jmer4@published"
                    data-editable="text" data-component-name="paragraph" data-article-gutter="true">
                    Satellite imagery taken before the US strikes on Iran’s Fordow nuclear facility suggests there may
                    have been attempts to reinforce the entrances of the mountainside complex.
                </p>

                <p class="paragraph inline-placeholder paragraph"
                    data-uri="cms.cnn.com/_components/paragraph/instances/cmc76vpum000c3b6nktkj8aju@published"
                    data-editable="text" data-component-name="paragraph" data-article-gutter="true">
                    In the days leading up to the US strikes on Iran’s Fordow Fuel Enrichment Plant, satellite imagery
                    appears to show dirt accumulated in front of at least two of the underground facility’s entrances.
                </p>

                <p class="paragraph inline-placeholder paragraph"
                    data-uri="cms.cnn.com/_components/paragraph/instances/cmc76vpum000d3b6ngmrgiunw@published"
                    data-editable="text" data-component-name="paragraph" data-article-gutter="true">
                    An image taken on June 19th shows a line of sixteen dump trucks near the entrances, along with
                    earthmoving equipment.
                </p>

                <p class="paragraph inline-placeholder paragraph"
                    data-uri="cms.cnn.com/_components/paragraph/instances/cmc76vpum000e3b6n4v8jsmul@published"
                    data-editable="text" data-component-name="paragraph" data-article-gutter="true">
                    In an image taken the following day, portions of the road into the tunnels appear to be covered by
                    dirt as loaded dump trucks continue to drive up to the tunnel entrances. Nearby earth moving
                    equipment can be seen scooping up soil.
                </p>

                <div data-uri="cms.cnn.com/_components/image/instances/cmc76x3mx000h3b6ne5lkudp4@published"
                    class="image image__hide-placeholder" data-image-variation="image"
                    data-name="maxar_fordow_entrances_annotated_June20.jpg" data-component-name="image"
                    data-observe-resizes=""
                    data-breakpoints="{&quot;image--eq-extra-small&quot;: 115, &quot;image--eq-small&quot;: 300, &quot;image--eq-large&quot;: 660}"
                    data-original-ratio="0.5950413223140496" data-original-height="1080" data-original-width="1815"
