                            <span data-editable="metaCaption" class="inline-placeholder">Graphic by Thomas
                                Bordeaux</span>

                        </div>
                        <figcaption class="image__credit">Maxar Technologies</figcaption>
                    </div>

                </div>

                <p class="paragraph inline-placeholder paragraph"
                    data-uri="cms.cnn.com/_components/paragraph/instances/cmc76vpum000f3b6npb3kmxpe@published"
                    data-editable="text" data-component-name="paragraph" data-article-gutter="true">
                    <strong>For context:</strong> The secretive, heavily guarded Fordow complex is built deep into a
                    mountainside and is therefore reinforced against an attack. Its main halls are an estimated 80 to 90
                    meters (around 262 to 295 feet) beneath the ground. Analysts and Israeli officials have said <a
                        href="https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cnn.com%2F2025%2F06%2F17%2Fmiddleeast%2Firan-fordow-nuclear-site-latam-hnk-intl&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cjerome.taylor%40cnn.com%7C49f6a2605a3a45f11b9808ddb147b092%7C0eb48825e8714459bc72d0ecd68f1f39%7C0%7C0%7C638861643710164923%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=6lP6kA8siAbE2vNGDDnKCWiGPfm1Gqo95vV%2BzssXMj4%3D&amp;reserved=0"
                        target="_blank">only the US had bombs big enough</a> to penetrate the complex.
                </p>

